      486.9
    ],
    "text": "Declaration under Section 5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      499.02,
      295.22,
      554.94
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms do hereby declare, under the Sub-section (1) of Section 5 ofthe Land Acquisition Act that the land described below is requred fora public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of thatAct.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      567.78,
      295.21,
      636.3
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of Land called \u2018\u2018Udawanatha\u2019\u2019 in extent about 0.638Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Advanced Tracing No. MAHA/UDD/97/314 prepared by the Superintendent of Survey-Kandy on05.03.1998, situated in Meemure Village in the Gandeka Korale inUdadumbara Divisional Secretariat in Kandy District is bounded asfollows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.17,
      455.34,
      547.18,
      498.66
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Udawanatha \u2013 Extent: 0.638 HectareNorth: Galkanda belongs to the state and Udawanatha chena;East: Udawanatha and Road; South: Road and Udawanatha chena;West: Udawanatha chena and Galkanda belongs to the state.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      379.17,
      510.9,
      547.18,
      532.02
    ],
